<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('head', { title: 'Your next move starts here', description: 'Find your chess community at Queen’s University. All levels welcome. Join us Thursdays, 6:00–9:00 PM in Jeffrey Hall, room 115.' }) %></head>
<body class="site-page">
<%- include('header') %>
<main id="main-content">
  <section class="home-hero site-shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-square"></span> Queen’s University · Kingston, ON</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Your next move<br>starts <em>here.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-intro">A good game. A new friend. A place at the board.<br class="desktop-break"> Welcome to your chess community at Queen’s.</p>
      <div class="button-row"><a class="button button-primary" href="#visit">Join us this Thursday <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="<%= club.discord %>">Join our Discord <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="hero-welcome"><span class="welcome-pieces" aria-hidden="true">♟ ♞ ♜</span><span>First game or thousandth.<br><strong>You’re in good company.</strong></span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="hero-photo"><img src="/images/optimized/chess.webp" alt="A player making their next move over a wooden chessboard" width="1200" height="667" fetchpriority="high"><div class="photo-caption"><span>Less scrolling. More chess.</span><span aria-hidden="true">01 / QCC</span></div></div>
      <div class="hero-stamp"><span>ALL LEVELS</span><strong aria-hidden="true">♞</strong><span>ONE COMMUNITY</span></div>
      <div class="checker-strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="meeting-band" id="visit" aria-labelledby="meeting-title">
    <div class="site-shell meeting-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your weekly chess fix</p><h2 id="meeting-title">See you Thursday.</h2><p>Drop by for a game. Stay for the company.</p></div>
      <div class="meeting-detail"><span class="detail-label">When</span><strong><%= club.meeting.day %></strong><span><%= club.meeting.time %></span></div>
      <div class="meeting-detail"><span class="detail-label">Where</span><strong><%= club.meeting.building %></strong><span>Room <%= club.meeting.room %> · Queen’s campus</span></div>
      <div class="meeting-actions"><a class="button button-gold" href="<%= club.meeting.maps %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Find your way <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a href="/meetings/next.ics" class="calendar-link" download>Add a club night to your calendar <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <p class="site-shell meeting-note">Check <a href="<%= club.discord %>">Discord</a> for holiday breaks, room changes, and weekly announcements.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell section-space" aria-labelledby="belong-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Make yourself at home</p><h2 id="belong-title">There’s a seat for you.</h2></div><p>Students, faculty, and community members.<br>All backgrounds. All ratings. All welcome.</p></div>
    <div class="offering-grid">
      <a class="offering" href="#visit"><span class="offering-top"><span class="piece-icon" aria-hidden="true">♞</span><span class="card-number">01</span></span><h3>Just play.</h3><p>Unwind with casual games, try a new opening, or find your next friendly rival at our weekly meetups.</p><span class="card-link">Find a game <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
      <a class="offering" href="/coaching"><span class="offering-top"><span class="piece-icon" aria-hidden="true">♙</span><span class="card-number">02</span></span><h3>Learn a little.</h3><p>New to chess? Build your confidence with puzzles, game discussions, and help from experienced players.</p><span class="card-link">Explore coaching <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
      <a class="offering" href="/eventsPage"><span class="offering-top"><span class="piece-icon" aria-hidden="true">♜</span><span class="card-number">03</span></span><h3>Make your move.</h3><p>From fast-paced blitz to university team championships, discover the competitive side of the club.</p><span class="card-link">Explore our events <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="community-section">
    <div class="site-shell community-grid">
      <figure><img src="/images/optimized/cucc-2026.webp" alt="Queen’s Chess Club members together at the 2026 Canadian University Chess Championship" width="948" height="648" loading="lazy"><figcaption>Our crew at CUCC 2026 · Hart House, Toronto</figcaption></figure>
      <div class="community-copy"><p class="eyebrow">More than 64 squares</p><h2>Come for the chess.<br>Stay for the people.</h2><p>We’re here to bring people together over a shared love of the game. Some of us are learning how the pieces move. Others are representing Queen’s at university championships.</p><p>What we have in common? There’s always another game to play, and someone to play it with.</p><a class="text-link" href="/execs">Meet the people behind the club <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell section-space" aria-labelledby="highlights-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Around the club</p><h2 id="highlights-title">Good moves. Great memories.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/eventsPage">All events <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="event-grid"><% [events[2], events[0], events[1]].forEach(event => { %><%- include('event-card', { event }) %><% }) %></div>
  </section>
  <section class="site-shell faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">First time here?</p><h2 id="faq-title">Let’s make<br>the first move easy.</h2><p>Still curious about something?<br><a class="text-link" href="mailto:<%= club.email %>">Send us a note ↗</a></p></div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details><summary>Do I need to know how to play?</summary><p>No experience needed. Come along, introduce yourself, and let us know you’re new. Our community welcomes players who are just learning the rules.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Who can join the club?</summary><p>Students, faculty, and community members are all welcome. You don’t need a rating or tournament experience to enjoy a game with us.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I come to a weekly meetup?</summary><p>Drop by <%= club.meeting.location %> on <%= club.meeting.day %> between <%= club.meeting.time %>. Check Discord before heading over for any schedule changes.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How can I hear about tournaments?</summary><p>Join our <a href="<%= club.discord %>">Discord</a> or follow us on <a href="<%= club.instagram %>">Instagram</a> for announcements. Our <a href="/eventsPage">events archive</a> gives you a feel for what we play.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>
  <%- include('join-banner') %>
</main>
<%- include('footer') %>
</body>
</html>
